# Keeps local installs, secrets, build output and logs out of every image's build context.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
**/.next
**/.next-*
**/dist
**/build
**/out
**/coverage
**/target
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
